{"2839180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Contract & Control", "steam_appid": 2839180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Adventure</strong> – Explore a vibrant world inspired by traditional RPGs with strategic <strong>turn-based combat</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit &amp; Control</strong> – Build your team by recruiting a wide variety of <strong>animal-themed characters</strong>—and even turn enemies into allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization</strong> – Equip characters with color-tiered <strong>weapons, armor, and spells</strong> to craft your ideal party setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overworld &amp; Dungeon Battles</strong> – Fight enemies in open-world encounters and <strong>delve into dangerous dungeons</strong> to gain experience and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World Systems</strong> – Experience immersive <strong>3D environments</strong> and an evolving <strong>in-game weather system</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather </strong>– Harvest resources through <strong>mining, fishing, and woodcutting</strong> to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Roster</strong> – Discover and recruit new animal allies as you progress and expand your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More to Discover</strong> – Packed with surprises and secrets you’ll uncover as you play.  </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Adventure</strong> – Explore a vibrant world inspired by traditional RPGs with strategic <strong>turn-based combat</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"